    <string name="get_handwriting">Get Handwriting</string>
    <string name="follow_steps_desc">Follow the simple steps to create your handwriting.</string>
    <string name="step_1">1) Download the template from </string>
    <string name="here">here.</string>
    <string name="step_2">2) Print this template and fill it. Try to fill it with free hand for adding some realistic look. You can also add some cutout letters in place of \'special characters\'.</string>
    <string name="step_3">3) Scan this template and send it to the below email address. After some time, you\'ll receive an email which will contain your font (otf) file.</string>
    <string name="writer_email">WRITER_EMAIL</string>
    <string name="step_4">4) Alternatively, instead of sending it to us, you can also create your otf file from Calligraphr. After building font, download \'otf\' file only.</string>
    <string name="open_calligraphr_tutorial">Open Calligraphr Tutorial</string>
    <string name="step_5">5) After obtaining your font (otf) file. Move it to the app\'s internal storage: Android/data/in.ashprog.assignmentwriter/files/Writer/Font folder with name as \'myWriting.otf\'.</string>
    <string name="step_6">6) That\'s it. You\'re good to go.</string>
    <string name="tip_calligraphr">Tip: While creating your font at Calligraphr, set Letter Spacing to 10% for adding realistic look.</string>
